Keep Chrome web notifications in Wayle's native notification history.

Chrome marks web notifications transient. Wayle displays those as popups but
normally drops them from history, so they disappear from its notification
panel. Mirror only Chrome/Chromium transient popups into Wayle's existing
in-memory history; the native notification dropdown and dashboard continue to
own rendering, dismissal, actions, grouping, and Do Not Disturb.

